    "id": "warranty-terms",
    "text": "Peak Saunas warranty covers, from date of delivery: heating elements 7 years; cabinetry and structure 7 years; control system and power supply 3 years; red light therapy panels 3 years; chromotherapy lighting 1 year; audio system 1 year; WiFi/app connectivity 1 year; accessories 1 year. Coverage applies to the original purchaser only and requires installation within 6 months of delivery.",
    "category": "trust",
    "source": "https://peaksaunas.com/pages/warranty",
    "approved_by": "site",
    "date": "2026-09-09"
  },
  {
    "id": "shipping-policy",
    "text": "Peak Saunas offers free shipping on all orders. In-stock items have a 2-4 business day handling time, then 3-7 business days in transit. Heavy/bulky items ship via LTL freight with a scheduled delivery appointment.",
    "category": "trust",
    "source": "https://peaksaunas.com/policies/shipping-policy",
    "approved_by": "site",
    "date": "2026-09-09"
  },
  {
    "id": "returns-policy",
    "text": "Peak Saunas returns require the sauna to be disassembled and repacked in its original crate; all returns are subject to a 25% restocking fee and the customer pays return shipping. Orders cancelled before shipping incur a 5% cancellation fee.",
